  "bio": "Alex is a renowned tattoo artist based in Brooklyn, United States, celebrated for their impeccable cleanliness. Each design, be it dotwork, minimalist, fineline, or floral, reflects their unique influences—from botany and the cosmos to the mystery of the urban jungle and the vastness of the ocean. Driven by a desire to offer a safe and healing experience in their studio, Alex's decade of travel and experience in over 20 shops has culminated in a space that welcomes every client with sterility and hygiene at the forefront of their practice.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Brooklyn, New York, United States"
